# held/civil/hammer: the smith's hammer (art weapon 6, the mace / hammer family) at rest, hung by its head through the belt
# on the left hip where a sword would ride, so the off hand rests on it (the arms' `armed` views) (PROPS, P2b; P2c swings
# it): an iron head over a pale ash handle. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. It serves the look's sheath and its held item at
# rest (role sheath mace, role held mace), on the sheath channel at the hip anchor: rest, lag a pixel behind the bob, sit
# (on the seat); `drawn` and `-` none (in hand), and none while the Hammer posture's hammer is in hand (prop-hammer). Facing right it is on the far hip,
# its handle showing behind the back leg.
use person
legend V linen 0
legend W linen 1
legend X linen 2
legend Y linen 3
legend Z linen 4
legend Q cloth3 0
legend R cloth3 1
legend S cloth3 2
legend T cloth3 3
legend U cloth3 4
legend I metal2 0
legend J metal2 4
body man woman
role sheath mace
role held mace
layer belt
anchor hip
keys sheath
z 30

view D key rest origin -1 3
|vvvvv
|vzyxv
|vxxwv
|.vQv.
|.QTQ.
|.QSQ.
|.QSQ.
|.QRQ.
|..Q..

